  "headline": "Sulfamethoxazole and trimethoprim is not on FDA's shortage list; Corvale East has 26.9 days on hand and Corvale General has 29.5 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include sulfamethoxazole and trimethoprim as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 401 tablets of the 800 mg + 160 mg presentation with a daily use of 14.9 tablets, providing 26.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 469 tablets of the same presentation with a daily use of 15.9 tablets, providing 29.5 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked purchasing option is Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, whose plant Amneal Pharmaceuticals Private Limited received an NAI classification on 2024-07-19.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A secondary option is Amneal Pharmaceuticals of New York LLC, which operates the AMNEAL PHARMS NY plant.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A third option is Aurobindo Pharma Limited, though its label does not name a plant that can be placed in our records.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    }
  ]
